1
00:00:08,383 --> 00:00:12,533
Cosmic rain is falling down

2
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:16,800
Build a frame to catch it now

3
00:00:16,917 --> 00:00:18,667
Four tall posts

4
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:20,800
Sixteen short

5
00:00:21,183 --> 00:00:23,200
Sixty-four brackets

6
00:00:23,317 --> 00:00:25,400
T-nuts: one fifty-six

7
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:27,533
One twenty-eight screws

8
00:00:27,583 --> 00:00:29,333
Four long screws

9
00:00:29,717 --> 00:00:31,733
Four rubber feet

10
00:00:31,850 --> 00:00:33,933
And one hex key!

11
00:00:33,983 --> 00:00:37,333
Slide the T-nuts in the slot

12
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:41,867
Bracket, screw, and turn the key

13
00:00:42,517 --> 00:00:46,133
Do it sixteen times, don't stop

14
00:00:46,783 --> 00:00:50,400
Sixteen beams with wings on top

15
00:00:51,050 --> 00:00:54,667
Stand four pillars in a square

16
00:00:55,317 --> 00:00:58,933
Eight nuts, eight screws, lock the base

17
00:00:59,583 --> 00:01:03,200
Bottom ring is bolted there

18
00:01:03,850 --> 00:01:07,467
Now we're building up to space!

19
00:01:08,117 --> 00:01:11,733
Stack it, square it, bolt it tight

20
00:01:12,383 --> 00:01:16,000
Four millimeter, turn it right

21
00:01:16,650 --> 00:01:20,267
Ring by ring we build it high

22
00:01:20,917 --> 00:01:24,533
Catch the rain from the cosmic sky

23
00:01:25,183 --> 00:01:28,533
Flip it over, upside down

24
00:01:29,450 --> 00:01:32,800
Twenty-five mil, screw it in

25
00:01:33,717 --> 00:01:37,067
Rubber feet to hold the ground

26
00:01:37,983 --> 00:01:41,600
Dab of blue to lock it in

27
00:01:42,250 --> 00:01:46,400
Three black paddles, plastic glow

28
00:01:46,517 --> 00:01:50,667
Drop them through the rings below

29
00:01:50,783 --> 00:01:54,933
Silicon eyes wait in the dark

30
00:01:55,050 --> 00:01:58,667
One muon, three sparks!

31
00:01:59,317 --> 00:02:02,933
Stack it, square it, bolt it tight

32
00:02:03,583 --> 00:02:07,200
Four millimeter, turn it right

33
00:02:07,850 --> 00:02:11,467
Three flashes at the speed of light

34
00:02:12,117 --> 00:02:15,733
Catch the rain from the cosmic sky

35
00:02:16,383 --> 00:02:20,533
Cosmic rain is falling down

36
00:02:20,650 --> 00:02:24,800
Now we catch it, safe and sound

